# @ungated reads this box's state/heartbeat/ files. A holder cannot see another box's dead lane, so each box reaps its own.

# lane-liveness reaper (operator line, outside managed blocks; BH-638). A dead lane
# and a lane with nothing to do look identical, so every long-lived lane writes
# state/heartbeat/<lane>.<pid>.json and this pass pages ONCE for one that went silent
# or died. No lock and no signal, so sharing the minute with the conductor costs
# nothing. Knobs: HB_* in env/global.env. docs/verification-map/lane-heartbeat.md
*/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/heartbeat-reaper.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
